 "clock_root": "ELEM-GAPS/HBMN2 2026-10-18: hfd_ckgen is the HBM die clock ROOT (PLL hard core ot_hbm_pll_bb + closed leaf hfd_ckgen_rel4, parent = wires). The export's --all-clocks measurement failed (exit 1) because the SDC sources the four domain clocks on the PLL OUTPUT pins (no port clock) and leaves the PLL refclk input unclocked; ck_insertion now maps each PLL-pin clock to its divide_by-1 forwarded port and skips the unclocked reference input of a clock-source macro. Measured on the routed job hbm_ckgen_cl-cl1-c3fc50d5c (6_final.odb + SPEF, raw source), child libs = physical/hbm_pll_views/ot_hbm_pll_bb and physical/ref_tile/hbm_ckgen_rel4/views/hfd_ckgen_rel4 (git trees identical at c3fc50d5c and main). Per domain: PLL pin -> rel4 clock pin 15.3 ps TT/15.4 FF; at the release flops (child-flop basis) 58.7 TT / 48.1 FF; one sink group per domain, spread 0. The die clock trees start at the pll_* ports (generated clocks), so the die compensates no R at this block; por_* launch is timed against pll_<d>_o by hfd_ckgen_parent_io.tcl (route verdict TT +14.96 / FF +175.92)."
